# oryxel-ai — project overview

## Stack

| Layer           | Technology                                             |
| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| Framework       | SvelteKit 2 + Svelte 5 (runes)                         |
| Language        | TypeScript                                             |
| CSS             | Tailwind CSS v4                                        |
| ORM             | Drizzle ORM                                            |
| Database        | Railway PostgreSQL via postgres.js in `packages/db`    |
| Auth            | Better Auth + `drizzleAdapter`; database-only sessions |
| i18n            | Paraglide.js (inlang)                                  |
| Tests           | Vitest, Playwright                                     |
| Deploy          | Vercel web + Railway worker/gateway/PostgreSQL/Redis   |
| Package manager | bun                                                    |

## Repository layout

- **Routes & pages:** `apps/web/src/routes/` (`+page.svelte`, `+page.server.ts`, layouts, `+server.ts`).
- **Database:** `packages/db/src/` (`index.ts`, `schema.ts`, `auth.schema.ts`) and append-only `packages/db/drizzle/`.
- **Runtime services:** `apps/worker`, `apps/job-stream-gateway`; shared domain logic is in `packages/ai`.
- **Hooks:** `apps/web/src/hooks.server.ts` (Paraglide + Better Auth), `apps/web/src/hooks.ts` (URL de-localization).
- **Messages:** `messages/{en,es,fr,ja,ru,zh}.json` — see `project.inlang/settings.json` for locale list.

## Scripts (prefer bun)

See root and workspace `package.json` files: `dev`, `build`, `check`, `lint`, `format`, `test`, `verify`, app DB `db:generate` / `db:migrate`, and web `auth:schema`. `db:push` is local-only.
